{"id":"consciente","lemma":"consciente","pos":"adj","rank":1872,"glosses":["aware, cognizant","conscious","mindful"],"ipa":"/konsˈθjente/","forms":{"femininePlural":"conscientes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ea/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-consciente.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Eras tú consciente de eso?","en":"Were you aware of that?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461663","words":[{"g":"era, age","l":"era"},{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"that","l":"ése"}]},{"text":"Somos conscientes del problema.","en":"We're aware of the problem.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/611825","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"of the"},{"g":"problem"}]},{"text":"Yo soy consciente de ello.","en":"I'm aware of it.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/559086","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"it"}]},{"text":"Somos conscientes de la situación.","en":"We're aware of the situation.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/515235","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,null,null,{"g":"situation"}],"phrases":[[2,4,"of the"]]},{"text":"Yo estaba consciente del peligro.","en":"I was aware of the danger.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/803668","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null,{"g":"of the"},{"g":"danger, peril"}]}]}